# Everything here is excluded from the Docker build context.
#
# Without this file the context was 2.84 GB and took 78 seconds to transfer on
# every single build, because it swept up the Kaggle CSVs, the local
# virtualenv and the whole git history - none of which any image needs.

# The dataset. ~1.4 GB, and the containers read it from a bind mount, not from
# the image.
data/

# Local virtualenv. Built for the host's Python; the images install their own.
.venv/
venv/

# Generated state, all of it bind-mounted or regenerated in the container.
mlruns/
reports/
dbt/target/
dbt/logs/
dbt/dbt_packages/
airflow/logs/
airflow/airflow.db
*.duckdb

# Version control and CI.
.git/
.github/
.gitignore

# Caches and build artifacts.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Editor and OS noise.
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store

# Secrets must never enter an image layer. .env.example is committed and
# carries no key; .env is the one with the real salt in it.
.env

# Notes and screenshots.
*.md
!README.md
